for lang in ['zh','en']:
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-single-file-storage-plan.mdx'
 text='''\n共享字段帧、实际回收与搬迁补齐见 `20261023-core-cost-cold-shared-lifecycle/`。新增夹具在同一实际逻辑 FieldPage 内存放 Node／Edge 各一组，二者有相同逻辑 owner ID、独立列／cold block／membership／group 记录及各自 GroupDirectory；实际 Entity、邻接、类型计数和 Catalog 均一致。Node 逆转换实际删除本组四个记录，保留另一个 namespace 的四个记录、原 slot／generation／逻辑 PageId 和独立目录，并通过普通 ROW／冷读取、旧 pin 与完整 integrity。该测试暴露并修复原逆转换写入边界错误：保留页虽已绑定 Hybrid owner，物理写池却使用普通页入口。现在只对独立保留池且全部 appends 为 Hybrid 的完整池调用既有 native 写入校验；新普通 ROW 池不混入，不扩大写权限。保留修复前 19 项中 1 项失败的实际证据。\n\n实际 LargeValueReachabilityReclaimer 验证当前冷大值可达、旧载体从当前 manifest／content index 退役、旧 pin 仍可读取旧值且不释放旧容量；pin 排空后再次回收证明物理槽释放或仍存活共享池的空闲帧增加，存活冷值及完整 integrity 保持。完全释放的 obsolete Catalog 记录可以被原回收器清除，检查通过公开 allocator／Catalog 接口判断槽或容量，不读取私有池头。实际 Node／Edge 共用字段池搬迁保留两类数据和逻辑位置、旧 pin，旧槽仅在 pin 释放后由原持久队列回收。20 项定向检查以及实验两种 membership 各 557 项相关模块、默认 154 项通过。\n\n这些仍是完整持久化测试夹具上的实际生命周期，不是前向公开转换或全库空间采用证明。跨组／混合 namespace 的同一变更批次、公开前向转换／实际转换后完整生命周期、全库私有 staged-target／空间准入、4096 字节完整查询与剩余主成本、最终 P7 仍未验收。进度 90%，没有全量单测、性能矩阵、提交或推送。\n''' if lang=='zh' else '''\nShared field frames, actual reclamation and relocation are completed in `20261023-core-cost-cold-shared-lifecycle/`. A coherent fixture stores Node/Edge groups with equal logical owner IDs in one actual logical FieldPage, with separate column/cold/membership/group records and GroupDirectories plus actual Entity/adjacency/type-count/Catalog state. Actual Node inverse removes its four records while retaining the other namespace's four records, slots/generations/logical PageId and directory; ordinary ROW/cold readers, old pins and full integrity verify it. This exposed an inverse physical-write bug: retained pages were bound to Hybrid owners but sent through the ordinary pool writer. Admit the existing native pool validation only for dedicated retained pools whose complete append set is Hybrid; keep new ordinary ROW pools separate and grant no wider authority. Preserve the original19-case report with one actual failure.\n\nActual LargeValueReachabilityReclaimer proves the current cold value reachable, retires the old carrier from current manifest/content index, preserves old-pin reads/capacity, then releases slots or increases free frames in a surviving shared pool after pins drain. Live cold values/full integrity remain intact. Existing reclamation may purge fully released obsolete Catalog entries; use public allocator/Catalog interfaces for slot/capacity checks, never private pool headers. Actual shared Node/Edge field-pool relocation preserves both kinds/logical routing/old pins; the original durable queue releases the old slot only after pin release.20 targeted cases,557 related module checks per experimental membership variant and154 default checks pass.\n\nThese are actual lifecycle operations on coherent durable fixtures, not forward public conversion/whole-space adoption. Cross-group/mixed-namespace mutation batches, public forward conversion/lifecycle on actually converted data, whole-space/private staged target admission,4096-byte full queries/primary costs and final P7 remain open. Progress90%; no full suite/timing matrix/commit/push.\n'''
 s=p.read_text();assert '20261023-core-cost-cold-shared-lifecycle/' not in s;p.write_text(s+text)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/optimization.mdx';s=p.read_text()
 if lang=='zh':
  old='并验证旧 pin、完整 integrity、索引／唯一／非空约束、A/B 重开、取消／退款／重试；';new='并验证共享字段帧保留、大值回收、字段池搬迁／退役、旧 pin、完整 integrity、索引／唯一／非空约束、A/B 重开、取消／退款／重试；'
  old2='补齐跨组／混合 namespace、共享字段帧实际保留分支及完整回收／搬迁，再接通';new2='补齐跨组／混合 namespace 的同一变更批次，再接通'
 else:
  old='with old pins, full integrity, indexes/unique/required constraints, A/B reopen, cancellation/refunds/retry.';new='with shared-field-frame retention, value reclamation, field-pool relocation/retirement, old pins, full integrity, indexes/unique/required constraints, A/B reopen, cancellation/refunds/retry.'
  old2='cross-group/mixed namespaces, actual shared-field-frame retention and complete reclamation/relocation, then';new2='cross-group/mixed-namespace mutation batches, then'
 assert old in s and old2 in s;s=s.replace(old,new,1).replace(old2,new2,1);p.write_text(s)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-capability-acceptance-matrix.mdx';s=p.read_text();s+= ('\n共享字段帧实际逆转换／冷大值回收／字段池搬迁：`20261023-core-cost-cold-shared-lifecycle/` 验证不同 namespace 共用帧的保留、原 native 写池合同、旧 pin 阻止回收及排空后的槽／容量释放。仍不是公开前向转换或空间采用；跨组变更批次、全库准入与 P7 未完成，进度 90%。\n' if lang=='zh' else '\nActual shared-frame inverse/cold-value reclamation/field-pool relocation: `20261023-core-cost-cold-shared-lifecycle/` verifies namespace retention, original native pool contract, pin-protected capacity and release after draining. No forward public conversion/space adoption acceptance; cross-group batches, whole-space admission and P7 remain open, progress90%.\n');p.write_text(s)
